        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "[codex] Refine quota warning markers for updated UI",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Render quota warning markers with the same punch-out treatment as the pace stripe.\n- Make warning markers full-height with a slimmer neutral stripe so they stay visible in the updated UI without looking like the green pace marker.\n- Add geometry coverage for full-height marker placement and display-scale centering.\n\n## Why replace the softened marker style\n\nThe previous softened marker was an inset hairline. In the updated menu-card UI it could visually disappear into the filled progress bar and it did not align with the existing pace marker language. The full-height punch-out treatment reuses the established pace-stripe rendering model: first cut through the accumulated track/fill pixels, then draw a slimmer neutral stripe. This keeps quota warning thresholds visible in both filled and track regions while keeping them visually distinct from the green pace marker.\n\n## Visual proof\n\nRedacted local runtime menu-card crops are below. Private account details, email addresses, and cost sections are excluded by cropping to the marker rows.\n\nBefore: softened 1px-style warning marker in a normal row.\n\n![Before: softened 1px quota warning marker](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alekstodo/CodexBar/proof/quota-warning-markers-updated-ui/proof/quota-warning-markers/before-1px-weekly-crop.png)\n\nAfter: full-height punch-out warning marker in the updated UI.\n\n![After: full-height punch-out quota warning marker](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alekstodo/CodexBar/proof/quota-warning-markers-updated-ui/proof/quota-warning-markers/after-punchout-weekly-crop.png)\n\nSide-by-side comparison:\n\n![Before/after quota warning marker comparison](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Alekstodo/CodexBar/proof/quota-warning-markers-updated-ui/proof/quota-warning-markers/quota-warning-marker-before-after.png)\n\n## Validation\n\n- `DEVELOPER_DIR=/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer swift test --filter MenuCardQuotaWarningMarkerTests` — 11 tests passed\n- `DEVELOPER_DIR=/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer swift test --filter MenuCardModelTests` — 62 tests passed\n- `DEVELOPER_DIR=/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer ./Scripts/lint.sh lint-macos` — exit 0; SwiftFormat reported 0/1265 files require formatting\n- `DEVELOPER_DIR=/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer .build/lint-tools/bin/swiftlint lint --strict Sources/CodexBar/UsageProgressBar.swift Tests/CodexBarTests/MenuCardQuotaWarningMarkerTests.swift` — 0 violations\n- `DEVELOPER_DIR=/Applications/Xcode.app/Contents/Developer CODEXBAR_SIGNING=adhoc ./Scripts/package_app.sh release` — release bundle built\n- `codesign --verify --deep --strict --verbose=2 /Applications/CodexBar.app` — installed PR build is valid on disk and satisfies its designated requirement",
